    {
      "bbox": [
        157,
        1450,
        1656,
        1601
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Reference is made to my Executive Memorandum of October 3, 1960 and to my remarks of October 18, 1960 at the Organization Meeting of the Traffic and Construction Coordinating Council, copies of which are attached hereto.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2818,
          "min": -1.4987
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 55,
          "mean": -0.0012,
          "min": -0.0621
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 12062,
        "area_px": 212648,
        "density": 0.05672,
        "chars": 220,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 18.24
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157,
        1631,
        1620,
        1740
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "When the Council was originally organized in the Office of the Mayor, Highway activities were divided among five autonomous Borough Agencies.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2317,
          "min": -1.1524
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 23,
          "mean": -0.0007,
          "min": -0.0142
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7044,
        "area_px": 149930,
        "density": 0.04698,
        "chars": 141,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.02
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        152,
        1766,
        1620,
        1904
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The new Charter, which became effective January 1, 1963 has centralized all Highway and Permit activities in one Department under the jurisdiction of the Mayor.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2316,
          "min": -1.4994
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 33,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0007
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 7642,
        "area_px": 188094,
        "density": 0.04063,
        "chars": 160,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 20.94
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        149,
        1945,
        1676,
        2051
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "It is therefore directed that the Chairmanship of the Traffic and Construction Coordinating Council be transferred to the Department of Highways.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2459,
          "min": -1.3721
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 26,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.001
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6255,
        "area_px": 151833,
        "density": 0.0412,
        "chars": 145,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 23.18
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        146,
        2081,
        1625,
        2222
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The prime objective of this coordination is to reduce to a minimum the disruption of civic life caused by the construction and reconstruction, both public and private, which affect all our residents and visitors.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2413,
          "min": -1.3751
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 37,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0027
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 6206,
        "area_px": 192888,
        "density": 0.03217,
        "chars": 212,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 34.16
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        141,
        2263,
        1597,
        2451
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "All City Departments and Agencies, insofar as their activities affect our Highways and Streets, are requested to cooperate with the Department of Highways and participate in the operation of this Council, so that the objectives of this Coordination may be realized.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2563,
          "min": -1.3063
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 49,
          "mean": -0.0002,
